edicated partner. Becky Pendergast Director of Design and Digital Platforms, American Association of Geographers\",\n   \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"slide is-selected\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(0%);\\\"> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Testimonial_%20Becky%20Pendergast.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> <div class=\\\"client-info\\\"> <p class=\\\"testimonial\\\">Free Range helped us make geography cool. Their unique combination of storytelling excellence, technical expertise, and diligent dedication created our innovative, accessible web presence, while migrating and preserving much of the valuable historic content from our 10-year-old website. They transformed our initial vision into a simplified, personalized, seamless user experience. This required much flexibility and forward-thinking as we concurrently built and launched a powerful membership database. The result is a beautiful, user-friendly, versatile, and scalable web experience—on both the front and back end—overwhelmingly embraced by visitors, members and staff. We regard them as a professional, dedicated partner.</p> <p class=\\\"name\\\">Becky&nbsp;Pendergast</p> <p class=\\\"title\\\">Director of Design and Digital Platforms, American Association of Geographers</p> </div> </div>\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"cls\": \"slide\",\n   \"rect\": {\n    \"x\": 1248,\n    \"y\": 6894,\n    \"width\": 1056,\n    \"height\": 410.6171875,\n    \"top\": 6894,\n    \"right\": 2304,\n    \"bottom\": 7304.6171875,\n    \"left\": 1248\n   },\n   \"img\": \"https://freerange.com/hubfs/FR_Testimonial_Lewis%20Perkins.png\",\n   \"quote\": \"\\\"Free Range has been instrumental in helping us build out our digital strategy and online identity. Their page builder is very easy for our team to work with, and they go above and beyond to make sure our team is set up for success. I definitely recommend working with them.\\\"\",\n   \"allText\": \"\\\"Free Range has been instrumental in helping us build out