rganization is thrilled to now be executing on!”\",\n   \"allText\": \"“Free Range helped us envision how we can make an even greater impact with our work. [...] By the end of the project, they had brought our collective ideas and insights together into a terrific plan that our organization is thrilled to now be executing on!” Robert Thomas Executive Director, Mindful Schools\",\n   \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(300%);\\\"> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/FR_Testimonial_Robert%20Thomas.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> <div class=\\\"client-info\\\"> <p class=\\\"testimonial\\\">“Free Range helped us envision how we can make an even greater impact with our work. [...] By the end of the project, they had brought our collective ideas and insights together into a terrific plan that our organization is thrilled to now be executing on!”</p> <p class=\\\"name\\\">Robert Thomas</p> <p class=\\\"title\\\">Executive Director, Mindful Schools</p> </div> </div>\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"cls\": \"slide\",\n   \"rect\": {\n    \"x\": 4416,\n    \"y\": 6894,\n    \"width\": 1056,\n    \"height\": 410.6171875,\n    \"top\": 6894,\n    \"right\": 5472,\n    \"bottom\": 7304.6171875,\n    \"left\": 4416\n   },\n   \"img\": \"https://freerange.com/hubfs/FR_Testimonial_Nicole%20Woodie.png\",\n   \"quote\": \"Organizing programs to help the most vulnerable through an engaging digital presence is core to our strategy. The Free Range team has been essential in helping us identify opportunities, design compelling brands and establish messaging for our multiple programs, and ultimately [employ] the technical skills and process to effectively implement new technologies with exceptional user experiences.\",\n   \"allText\": \"Organizing programs to help the most vulnerable through an engaging digital presence is core to our strategy. The Free Range team has been essential in helping us identify opportunities, design compelling brands and establish messaging for our multiple programs, and ultimately [employ] the technical skills and process to effectively implement new technologies with exceptional user experiences. Nicole Woodie Executive Director, The Chris Long Foundation\",\n   \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(400%);\\\"> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/FR_Testimonial_Nicole%20Woodie.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> <div class=\\\"client-info\\\"> <p class=\\\"testimonial\\\">Organizing programs to help the most vulnerable through an engaging digital presence is core to our strategy. The Free Range team has been essential in helping us identify opportunities, design compelling brands and establish messaging for our multiple programs, and ultimately [employ] the technical skills and process to effectively implement new technologies with exceptional user experiences.</p> <p class=\\\"name\\\">Nicole Woodie</p> <p class=\\\"title\\\">Executive Director, The Chris Long Foundation</p> </div> </div>\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"cls\": \"slide\",\n   \"rect\": {\n    \"x\": 5472,\n    \"y\": 6894,\n    \"width\": 1056,\n    \"height\": 497,\n    \"top\": 6894,\n    \"right\": 6528,\n    \"bottom\": 7391,\n    \"left\": 5472\n   },\n   \"img\": \"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Stephen-danner-headshot-stand-cropped.png\",\n   \"quote\": \"As a growing environmental advocacy organization, we needed more cohesive messaging to support our ambitions for even bigger impact. We wanted a content strategy that would help reduce the cognitive dissonance it sometimes took for new audiences to understand exactly who we are and what we do.\\n\\nFree Range quickly stood out to us as a group that has deep experience with non-profits, and a familiarity with the climate justice space. During our work together, they crafted timeless and adaptable writing, design, and development, and came up with a number of inventive “good moves” that gave us new ways to speak about ourselves. We also enjoyed efficient project management and easy communication throughout the process.\\nWe’re very happy with our new web copy and fundraising materials. I recommend Free Range to anyone looking for a strategy or messaging partner.\",\n   \"allText\": \"As a growing environmental advocacy organization, we needed more cohesive messaging to support our ambitions for even bigger impact. We wanted a content strategy that would help reduce the cognitive dissonance it sometimes took for new audiences to understand exactly who we are and what we do. Free Range quickly stood out to us as a group that has deep experience with non-profits, and a familiarity with the climate justice space. During our work together, they crafted timeless and adaptable writing, design, and development, and came up with a number of inventive “good moves” that gave us new ways to speak about ourselves. We also enjoyed efficient project management and easy communication throughout the process. We’re very happy with our new web copy and fundraising materials. I recommend Free Range to anyone looking for a strategy or messaging partner. Stephen Danner Director of Develop\",\n   \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(500%);\\\"> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/Stephen-danner-headshot-stand-cropped.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> <div class=\\\"client-info\\\"> <p class=\\\"testimonial\\\">As a growing environmental advocacy organization, we needed more cohesive messaging to support our ambitions for even bigger impact. We wanted a content strategy that would help reduce the cognitive dissonance it sometimes took for new audiences to understand exactly who we are and what we do. Free Range quickly stood out to us as a group that has deep experience with non-profits, and a familiarity with the climate justice space. During our work together, they crafted timeless and adaptable writing, design, and development, and came up with a number of inventive “good moves” that gave us new ways to speak about ourselves. We also enjoyed efficient project management and easy communication throughout the process. We’re very happy with our new web copy and fundraising materials. I recommend Free Range to anyone looking for a strategy or messaging partner.</p> <p class=\\\"name\\\">Stephen Danner</p> <p class=\\\"title\\\">Director of Development, Stand.earth</p> </div> </div>\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"cls\": \"slide\",\n   \"rect\": {\n    \"x\": 6528,\n    \"y\": 6894,\n    \"width\": 1056,\n    \"height\": 525,\n    \"top\": 6894,\n    \"right\": 7584,\n    \"bottom\": 7419,\n    \"left\": 6528\n   },\n   \"img\": \"https://freerange.com/hubfs/EeraBabtiwale-e1656019604562-cropped.png\",\n   \"quote\": \"We wanted to create a short video that would explain the concept of “sustainability” to students, faculty and staff, and outline how Mt. SAC can help students prepare for further studies or careers in sustainability. But we struggled to find an inspiring and succinct way of communicating everything that “sustainability” can mean. \\nWe saw Free Range’s prior work and admired their approach to white board animation. As nonprofessionals, we were not aware of all the details that go into a production like this, for example having a voice actor and how much that impacts the feel/vibe of the video. Our project manager laid out a clear work plan, and led us smoothly through the whole process, acting as our companion through the entire project. We now have a polished, inclusive, and easy-to-understand video that we can share campus-wide—in classrooms, at events, and on our website. I highly recommend working with Free Range on your next video project.\",\n   \"allText\": \"We wanted to create a short video that would explain the concept of “sustainability” to students, faculty and staff, and outline how Mt. SAC can help students prepare for further studies or careers in sustainability. But we struggled to find an inspiring and succinct way of communicating everything that “sustainability” can mean. We saw Free Range’s prior work and admired their approach to white board animation. As nonprofessionals, we were not aware of all the details that go into a production like this, for example having a voice actor and how much that impacts the feel/vibe of the video. Our project manager laid out a clear work plan, and led us smoothly through the whole process, acting as our companion through the entire project. We now have a polished, inclusive, and easy-to-understand video that we can share campus-wide—in classrooms, at events, and on our website. I highly recomm\",\n   \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"slide\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0px; transform: translateX(600%);\\\"> <img src=\\\"https://freerange.com/hubfs/EeraBabtiwale-e1656019604562-cropped.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"> <div class=\\\"client-info\\\"> <p class=\\\"testimonial\\\">We wanted to create a short video that would explain the concept of “sustainability” to students, faculty and staff, and outline how Mt. SAC can help students prepare for further studies or careers in sustainability. But we struggled to find an inspiring and succinct way of communicating everything that “sustainability” can mean. We saw Free Range’s prior work and admired their approach to white board animation. As nonprofessionals, we were not aware of all the details that go into a production like this, for example having a voice actor and how much that impacts the feel/vibe of the video. Our project manager laid out a clear work plan, and led us smoothly through the whole process, acting as our companion through the entire project. We now have a polished, inclusive, and easy-to-understand video that we can share campus-wide—in classrooms, at events, and on our website. I highly recommend working with Free Range on your next video project.</p> <p class=\\\"name\\\">Eera Babtiwale</p> <p class=\\\"title\\\">Director of Sustainability, Mt. San Antonio College</p> </div> </div>\"\n  }\n ],\n \"btns\": [\n  {\n   \"cls\": \"flickity-button flickity-prev-next-button previous\",\n   \"rect\": {\n    \"x\": 112,\n    \"y\": 7090.5,\n    \"width\": 48,\n    \"height\": 48,\n    \"top\": 7090.5,\n    \"right\": 160,\n    \"bottom\": 7138.5,\n    \"left\": 112\n   },\n   \"styles\": {\n    \"position\": \"absolute\",\n    \"top\": \"220.5px\",\n    \"right\": \"1168px\",\n    \"bottom\": \"196.5px\",\n    \"width\": \"48px\",\n    \"height\": \"48px\",\n    \"backgroundColor\": \"rgb(48, 139, 245)\",\n    \"backgroundPosition\": \"0% 0%\",\n    \"padding\": \"5px\",\n    \"margin\": \"-24px 0px 0px\",\n    \"display\": \"flex\",\n    \"flexDirection\": \"row\",\n    \"alignItems\": \"center\",\n    \"justifyContent\": \"center\",\n    \"fontSize\": \"19px\",\n    \"fontWeight\": \"400\",\n    \"color\": \"rgb(255, 255, 255)\",\n    \"lineHeight\": \"28px\",\n    \"border\": \"0px none rgb(255, 255, 255)\",\n    \"borderBottom\": \"0px none rgb(255, 255, 255)\",\n    \"borderTop\": \"0px none rgb(255, 255, 255)\",\n    \"opacity\": \"1\",\n    \"transition\": \"all\",\n    \"textAlign\": \"center\",\n    \"marginTop\": \"-24px\",\n    \"paddingTop\": \"5px\",\n    \"paddingBottom\": \"5px\",\n    \"paddingLeft\": \"5px\",\n    \"paddingRight\": \"5px\",\n    \"flex\": \"0 1 auto\",\n    \"objectFit\": \"fill\",\n    \"textOverflow\": \"clip\",\n    \"cursor\": \"pointer\"\n   },\n   \"svgStyles\": {\n    \"fill\": \"rgb(0, 0, 0)\",\n    \"width\": \"16px\",\n    \"height\": \"16px\"\n   },\n   \"pathStyles\": {\n    \"fill\": \"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\n   }\n  },\n  {\n   \"cls\": \"flickity-button flickity-prev-next-button next\",\n   \"rect\": {\n    \"x\": 1280,\n    \"y\": 7090.5,\n    \"width\": 48,\n    \"height\": 48,\n    \"top\": 7090.5,\n    \"right\": 1328,\n    \"bottom\": 7138.5,\n    \"left\": 1280\n   },\n  